B.TE=s(['Khayt ("we", "us") is a fashion atelier. This storefront is currently a demonstration deployment: no real orders are fulfilled and no real payments are processed.',"This policy explains, as a real store would, what personal data a shop like this collects and how it should be protected. Contact: hello@khayt.example."],t.s)
B.abX=new A.bh("1. Who we are",B.TE)
B.Xk=s(["Contact details such as your name, email address, phone number and delivery address when you place an order or write to us.","Order details such as the items you buy, sizes, colours, order totals and delivery choices.","Payment details such as the card brand and the last four digits. In a live store the full card number, expiry date and security code are entered into a PCI-DSS compliant payment provider and are never stored on our own servers.","Technical data such as device type, browser, language preference and the pages you view, collected through cookies and similar technologies."],t.s)
B.abo=new A.bh("2. Information we collect",B.Xk)
B.a3e=s(["To process and deliver your orders, send confirmations and handle returns.","To provide customer support and respond to your messages.","To prevent fraud and keep the site secure, including card verification.","To improve the website, for example by learning which products and pages are most useful.","To send marketing emails only if you have opted in. You can unsubscribe at any time."],t.s)
B.abJ=new A.bh("3. How we use your information",B.a3e)
B.a2Z=s(["In this demonstration, everything you type in the checkout form stays inside your browser tab. Nothing is sent to a server, nothing is stored, and the card form validates the format of the number locally only. Please do not enter a real card number; use the test card shown on the checkout page.","Your language choice and cart contents are kept in memory only and disappear when you close or refresh the page."],t.s)
B.abj=new A.bh("4. About this demo",B.a2Z)
B.Z1=s(["A live store would use essential cookies (cart, security), preference cookies (language) and optional analytics or marketing cookies. Non-essential cookies would only be set after your consent, and you could change your choice at any time. This demo sets no tracking cookies."],t.s)
B.abV=new A.bh("5. Cookies",B.Z1)
B.WR=s(["We never sell personal data. A real store shares data only with service providers who help it operate: payment processors, delivery carriers, email and hosting providers, and fraud-prevention services. They may only use the data to provide their service to us, under contract.","We may disclose data where required by law or to protect rights, safety and property."],t.s)
B.abu=new A.bh("6. Sharing your information",B.WR)
B.a3q=s(["Order and invoice records are kept for the period required by tax and accounting law (typically 6 to 10 years). Support messages are kept for up to 24 months. Marketing preferences are kept until you withdraw consent."],t.s)
B.abB=new A.bh("7. How long we keep it",B.a3q)
B.Vh=s(["Depending on where you live (for example under the GDPR or the CCPA) you can ask to access, correct, delete or export your personal data, to object to or restrict certain processing, and to withdraw consent at any time.","To exercise a right, write to hello@khayt.example. We reply within 30 days. You also have the right to complain to your local data protection authority."],t.s)
B.ac1=new A.bh("8. Your rights",B.Vh)
B.a_U=s(["We use encryption in transit (HTTPS), restricted access to personal data and regular reviews. No system is perfectly secure, so we also encourage strong, unique passwords and caution with unsolicited messages."],t.s)
B.abE=new A.bh("9. Security",B.a_U)
B.WQ=s(["If data is transferred outside your country, a real store would rely on lawful safeguards such as standard contractual clauses."],t.s)
B.abt=new A.bh("10. International transfers",B.WQ)
B.V2=s(["Our shop is not directed to children under 16 and we do not knowingly collect their data."],t.s)
B.abK=new A.bh("11. Children",B.V2)
B.a2U=s(['We may update this policy from time to time. The "last updated" date at the top shows the current version.'],t.s)
B.abC=new A.bh("12. Changes to this policy",B.a2U)
B.WJ=s(["Khayt Atelier, Studio 4, Loom Street 12, Berlin, Germany. Email: hello@khayt.example. Phone: +49 30 23125 000."],t.s)
B.abc=new A.bh("13. Contact",B.WJ)
